  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wildlife Without Borders-Western Hemisphere</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Recipient will strengthen their long-term capacity to provide leadership and programs which assist wildlife professionals, educators, community members and volunteers throughout the Caribbean to deliver biodiversity conservation. Specific objectives include: (1) Developing and building consensus with membership for a new Strategic Plan for 2014 2018 which addresses institutional strengthening and long-term sustainability; (2) Preparing and implementing a fundraising strategy that includes a branding and communication strategy; and (3) Supporting regional capacity building and information sharing by hosting a regional meeting at St. Georges, Grenada, in July 2013. A draft Strategic Plan will be presented and discussed with membership at the Grenada meeting during a day dedicated to this specific purpose. FWS may provide suggestions and input to the strategic plan, fundraising strategy, and regional meeting workshops focused on institutional strengthening.</narrative>
  </description>
